@host = http://localhost:5210
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..yCxwYbeZqxtNaudIZYwt8lzDZzx6Nw9oBrpf9xsI-nk

### A. MANAJEMEN ADMIN

### 1. Tarik Katalog dari Digiflazz (Sync)
POST {{host}}/admin/system/sync-digiflazz
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Sapu Bersih Data Dummy
DELETE {{host}}/admin/system/clean-dummy-products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 3. Lihat Semua Transaksi Masuk (View Admin)
GET {{host}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Upload Gambar Item Nominal (Contoh: Karung Diamond)
# Mengarah ke ID Produk di tabel GameProducts
POST {{host}}/admin/products/23/upload-item-image
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BatasMahaKarya

--BatasMahaKarya
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="item-diamond.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../Icons/ml-12.webp
--BatasMahaKarya--


### 5. Upload Gambar Cover Game Utama (Contoh: Banner Web)
# Mengarah ke ID Metadata di tabel GameMetadata (Contoh: ID 11 untuk Genshin Impact)
POST {{host}}/admin/system/metadata/1/upload-game-cover
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BatasMahaKarya

--BatasMahaKarya
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pb.webp"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../Icons/ff.webp
--BatasMahaKarya--


### B. SIMULASI WEBHOOK (TANPA TOKEN)

### 1. Simulasi Webhook Midtrans (Status Pembayaran Sukses)
POST {{host}}/webhooks/midtrans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": "INV-TEST-123",
  "status_code": "200",
  "gross_amount": "50000.00",
  "transaction_status": "settlement",
  "fraud_status": "accept",
  "signature_key": "dummy_signature"
}

### 2. Simulasi Webhook Digiflazz (SN Masuk)
POST {{host}}/webhooks/digiflazz
Content-Type: application/json
x-hub-signature: sha1=dummy_signature

{
  "data": {
    "ref_id": "INV-TEST-123",
    "status": "Sukses",
    "sn": "SN-992837465521",
    "message": "Transaksi Sukses"
  }
}